    {
      "_key": "5a1e7696e603",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "74db36f13e66",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "From interview to searchable database entry"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5b3c82669019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "032b0eb407a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The integration pays off most when it fits into the interview process without adding friction. Here's how the full lifecycle works with this stack."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8c5e48f5d7f7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "53b8b04dd515",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Pre-meeting:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3a924445caf2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Open Granola and select a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "af26d6bc2059",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "e99d62c0fd1b"
          ],
          "text": "custom interview template"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5f146ca94c39",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " with your discussion guide sections pre-structured: context, problem exploration, feature reactions, closing."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "e99d62c0fd1b",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5228c288183b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4c9360cfa9a9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "During the interview:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2ff1a8f80f49",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Jot rough bullets at key moments: a surprising quote, a feature request, an emotional reaction. Granola transcribes in the background without joining as a visible participant. No bot announcement, no awkward pause when a participant spots an unfamiliar name in the call. You stay present for follow-up questions while Granola captures the context you'll enhance afterward. You should still ask participants for permission to transcribe, but there's no visible recording technology creating friction."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d3e0136c90d6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d504ec0ec325",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Post-meeting:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1dc46cb60c25",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " When the call ends, Granola enhances your rough bullets with relevant context from the transcript. You review the output, confirm the key takeaways reflect what actually happened, and either push to Notion via the native integration or let the Zapier folder trigger fire automatically."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "73ff7d3ab9a0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "61729e666b1f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "In Notion:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "536a80623c10",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The new database entry appears with interview date, participant name, and Granola link pre-filled. You add customer segment, sentiment, and feature tags, then the entry is queryable by anyone on the team. Colleagues who weren't in the interview can follow the Granola link and explore the transcript context directly:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2d70c90a5c53",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2fd25e93c610",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"I can easily share my notes with my colleagues as well, and... we can all chat with the meeting transcript so everyone can see the full context of the meeting, even if they weren't there.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3a79001a44ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "227efa1962f4"
          ],
          "text": "Jess M. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7908d349ea4b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "227efa1962f4",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-9856422"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3d8381c1c72b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dc529d4a081d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The cumulative result: a research database that grows with every interview without adding meaningful overhead per session. When a stakeholder challenges your findings as anecdotal, you filter by feature tag and show the count. When a new PM joins the team, they query the database instead of asking you to reconstruct six months of discovery work."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e4c4ad8dcd34",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6a59ac7143e1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Advanced: Using Raycast to query your repository"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "de6fbd1ae71b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "37fe99e13cc7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1d424131ddb5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "6de404c02ead"
          ],
          "text": "Granola Raycast extension"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e5bb1398b4a1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " reduces retrieval friction to near zero for Mac users. Press your Raycast shortcut, type a search term, and get matching notes in seconds without opening a browser or navigating Notion filters."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "6de404c02ead",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.raycast.com/Rob/granola"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4911f07d32fa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9ee01934a406",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Practical queries:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f7b7cbd0800f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "46835d82785b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Search "
        },
        {
          "_key": "15432d111d58",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "\"SSO\""
        },
        {
          "_key": "bd2c16b5bdd2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to pull every customer conversation mentioning single sign-on across all interviews"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "22ddfeab7f06",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "089ced381809",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Search "
        },
        {
          "_key": "292a08f93ae5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "\"pricing\""
        },
        {
          "_key": "b1a2f2f63e35",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to surface budget friction mentions before a pricing review with leadership"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6d4e35d9f9b0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d7c9e9d01361",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use `@granola` in Raycast AI to ask: \"What were the most common onboarding complaints?\" and get a synthesized answer with source citations"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d3ad8fcc63a8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e4d83b4a1248",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The extension also includes direct Notion export, so you can push notes from Raycast into your database without opening either app."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1a76509c7b9e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "597e077c1b3a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Every conversation you capture now becomes a queryable entry your whole team can search later. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8624d60024a5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f3a2613f4f77"
          ],
          "text": "Download Granola"
        },
        {
          "_key": "42a8f9edb026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for Mac or Windows, connect your calendar, and run your next customer interview. Then open Settings, click Integrations, connect Notion, and start turning conversations into a database your whole team can query."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "f3a2613f4f77",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/download"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3a4c0c4e86a9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a754fc76c47b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Frequently asked questions"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fd46249e9dd0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e52a19006a60",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Does Granola send audio recordings to Notion?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "047869c82a6d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "512e8b3ef21c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No. Granola processes audio in real time and deletes it immediately after transcription, so what flows into Notion is note text, summary, and a link to the shared Granola note where teammates can query the transcript. You can verify the full security architecture on "
        },
        {
          "_key": "587f006d23e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "120b76af7bef"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's security page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6d3f60161cf1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "120b76af7bef",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/security"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e9cdfa11ffe3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "24868bdb51be",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can I map custom AI templates to specific Notion views?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2ba011d5555b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c5d6e44193a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. Granola's "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7ab649b0b9d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "731527175348"
          ],
          "text": "custom templates"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f232bfec2c48",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " let you define structured sections for different meeting types, and each template produces consistently structured output that maps to the same Notion database properties, keeping your database uniform even when interview formats vary."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "731527175348",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9f175667f6f2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "879ef91f7fb6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Is this workflow SOC 2 compliant?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "78933c816e6b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "32dc6c4fc9ef",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola achieved "
        },
        {
          "_key": "79d7aead1341",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "a1e1447e6292"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 certification"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3048cd2db5e2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in July 2025, completing the audit in approximately three months "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f3811dcd449c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "73e13fa3ff4f"
          ],
          "text": "as confirmed by Vanta's case study"
        },
        {
          "_key": "50af87c8764f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Third-party AI providers are contractually prohibited from training on your data. Consult your compliance team before using Granola with regulated data."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "a1e1447e6292",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        },
        {
          "_key": "73e13fa3ff4f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.vanta.com/customers/granola"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e4fca4ef51b8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f685b2404614",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What plan do I need to access the integration?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7aa7798baeb2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "af1684cde10e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Business plan at $14/user/month includes Notion, Slack, HubSpot, and Zapier integrations. The free plan does not include integration access."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "33cd3502c4b3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0c1db8b6662d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can I backfill historical notes into an existing Notion database?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8bfa6a99f8e4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "290e04fa6f0f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes. Granola's historical notes export function lets you pull down past notes, and the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "121025b5cd97",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "1b9ba396e922"
          ],
          "text": "Raycast extension"
        },
        {
          "_key": "35ff4e3d6f2a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " also supports individual note export to Notion. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b7b1eaf4e944",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "da27bd24ab93"
          ],
          "text": "exporting notes documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "12657dff740a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " covers the full range of available options."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "1b9ba396e922",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.raycast.com/Rob/granola"
        },
        {
          "_key": "da27bd24ab93",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/sharing/exporting-notes"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c0c4733d8ceb",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "950a2e9957e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Key terms glossary"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8c899fd26dc3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8bcf1ba4cc5f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Research repository:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "382f7985d0af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A structured, searchable database of customer and stakeholder conversations organized by properties like date, segment, and theme, so any team member can query past findings without asking the PM who ran the research."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0863072f30b7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ed226e7e71e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Synthesis:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ac7172170606",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The process of turning raw interview notes into patterns, themes, and actionable insights. In this workflow, Granola handles the first layer (enhanced notes from rough bullets), while Notion's tagging and filtering handles the second layer (pattern recognition across multiple interviews)."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bfc7d2270cbe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "accc6b2e50f4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Verbatim:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "651b9f5c3b99",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " An exact customer quote captured in the transcript. Verbatim quotes carry more persuasive weight with stakeholders than paraphrased summaries because they're clearly direct evidence rather than interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2455cfe55c3b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6924992da0ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Taxonomy:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "21746ef64738",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The classification system applied to research entries, specifically the set of values in your Feature Tags and Customer Segment properties. A well-designed taxonomy makes the difference between a searchable database and an unusable collection of inconsistent tags."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a22a6763d79e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "13cd0f8a9627",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "MCP (Model Context Protocol):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cb99b67ff621",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A standard protocol that allows compatible AI tools, including Claude, ChatGPT, and Cursor, to access your Granola "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4449cfb2ad15",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "51f3d34eec7a"
          ],
          "text": "meeting notes "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1c8e4e98352c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "when you request it. MCP is available on Business plans and above and connects your research repository to other AI-powered workflows without manual export."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "51f3d34eec7a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-meeting-assistant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
  "hidden": true,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "publishedAt": "2026-02-21",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "sync-granola-notes-notion-research-repository"
  },
  "summary": "Granola's native Notion integration and Zapier connector let you push structured meeting data directly into a Notion database. Instead of hunting through flat documents, you query a tagged, filterable research repository.",
  "title": "How to sync Granola notes to Notion for a searchable research repository"
}